        <div class="faq-grid">
          <article><h3>Can you help with artwork?</h3><p>Yes. Send us the artwork you have and we’ll check whether it is suitable for the selected production method. Basic layout assistance may be available, while more involved design work may be quoted separately.</p></article>
          <article><h3>How long will my order take?</h3><p>Turnaround depends on the product, quantity, artwork readiness and production method. We’ll confirm timing with your quote.</p></article>
          <article><h3>Can I collect?</h3><p>Yes, by appointment only. Please contact us before visiting so we can make sure someone is available to assist you.</p></article>
        </div>
